{"seq":19,"slug":"agent-security-boundaries","title":"面向 Agent 的安全与权限边界","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"面向-agent-的安全与权限边界\">面向 Agent 的安全与权限边界</h1><p>让一个语言模型替你读文件、装依赖、改代码、推分支——这件事在 2026 年已经是大多数工程团队的日常，但它把&quot;安全&quot;这门老学问推进到了一个全新的、令人不安的位置。传统软件的攻击面是确定的：你知道哪些输入会到达哪段代码。而一个编码 agent 把&quot;读到的任意文本&quot;和&quot;要执行的指令&quot;放进了同一条通道——它读的一个 GitHub issue、一段网页、一份依赖的 README，都可能在它毫无察觉时变成命令。这就是为什么 agent 安全不是&quot;在已有应用安全上加一层 LLM 过滤&quot;，而是一套需要从地基重新搭起的工程纪律。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 围绕一个核心问题展开：当你把越来越多的自主权交给一个会被文本操纵的执行体时，如何用工程手段把&quot;它能造成的最大伤害&quot;压到可接受的范围。我们不谈虚无缥缈的&quot;AI 对齐&quot;，只谈可落地的边界、控制与响应——能写进配置文件、能在 CI 里跑、能在事故时翻出日志的那种。</p>\n<p>四条主线层层递进。第一条是<strong>基础</strong>：先说清楚 agent 安全为什么特殊（自主性放大爆炸半径、同通道注入、&quot;致命三要素&quot;），再建立一套面向 agent 的威胁模型与注入面清单，最后落到贯穿全 hub 的总原则——最小权限。这三块是地基，后面所有具体手段都是它的展开。</p>\n<p>第二条是<strong>权限边界</strong>：把最小权限原则变成三道物理围栏——工具白名单决定 agent &quot;能调什么&quot;，沙箱与隔离决定它&quot;能碰到什么&quot;，凭据作用域决定它&quot;能拿到什么钥匙&quot;。这是事前的、静态的、纵深防御的第一层。</p>\n<p>第三条是<strong>控制措施</strong>：围栏挡不住的，靠运行时控制兜底。提示注入防御处理&quot;输入被污染&quot;，审批门与人工确认处理&quot;高危动作需要人点头&quot;，审计日志与可观测性处理&quot;出了事能复盘、合规能举证&quot;。这是运行时的动态防线。</p>\n<p>第四条是<strong>工程实践</strong>：把前面所有原则压进三个真实的生产关卡——MCP 服务器的供应链与工具投毒风险、CI 流水线里给 agent 套的护栏、以及当 agent 真的闯了祸之后的事故响应流程。这一章是把理论焊到流水线上的地方。</p>\n<p>阅读建议：如果你刚接触这个领域，从基础三篇顺序读下来，建立威胁直觉；如果你已经在跑 agent、想立刻收紧风险，可以直接跳到权限边界与控制措施挑你最缺的那道防线补上。无论从哪进入，整个 hub 用大量交叉链接连成一张网——同一个概念只在它的主篇深讲，其它地方点到即止并指过去，避免你重复读同样的内容。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-agent-security","title":"为什么 Agent 安全特殊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/foundations/why-agent-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"threat-model-injection","title":"威胁模型与注入面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/foundations/threat-model-injection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"least-privilege-principle","title":"最小权限原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/foundations/least-privilege-principle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"boundaries","title":"权限边界","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/boundaries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-allowlisting","title":"工具白名单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/boundaries/tool-allowlisting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sandboxing-isolation","title":"沙箱与隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/boundaries/sandboxing-isolation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"secrets-credential-scoping","title":"密钥与凭据作用域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/boundaries/secrets-credential-scoping"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"controls","title":"控制措施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/controls","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-injection-defense","title":"提示注入防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/controls/prompt-injection-defense"},{"seq":2,"slug":"approval-gates-human-in-loop","title":"审批门与人工确认","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/controls/approval-gates-human-in-loop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"audit-logging-observability","title":"审计日志与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/controls/audit-logging-observability"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mcp-server-security","title":"MCP 服务器安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/practice/mcp-server-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ci-agent-guardrails","title":"CI 中的 Agent 护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/practice/ci-agent-guardrails"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-response-agents","title":"Agent 事故响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-security-boundaries/practice/incident-response-agents"}]}]}